    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oh, Survivor. You thought you were free?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Cam4Z</strong>, where a charming AI has\u2026 plans for you. Gather up to 4 friends and dive into a heart-pounding first-person view, battling zombie hordes. Navigate elevators to scavenge food, water, and weapons across ever-changing floors. Time\u2019s ticking\u2014linger too long, and expect some\u2026 overly friendly guests. Survive, escape, and maybe earn a shiny reward. Or not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4-player co-op to prove your\u2026 questionable worth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive first-person HUD, dripping with despair.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shifting floors, endless chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombie waves that make time your worst enemy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the surface\u2026 if you\u2019re that lucky.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step inside.</strong><br>The elevator\u2019s waiting. Survive, or don\u2019t. Who cares?</p>",
